## Project Structure

```
backend/
├── prompts/
│   ├── system.txt          # Main RAG system prompt (parameterized)
│   ├── rewrite.txt         # Query rewriting prompt with few-shot examples
│   └── judge.txt           # LLM-as-judge evaluation prompt
├── src/
│   ├── main.ts             # NestJS + Fastify bootstrap
│   ├── app.module.ts       # Root module
│   ├── chat/
│   │   ├── chat.module.ts  # Module wiring
│   │   ├── chat.controller.ts  # POST /chat, POST /chat/clear
│   │   └── chat.service.ts     # Full RAG pipeline orchestration
│   ├── ingest/
│   │   ├── run-ingest.ts   # pnpm ingest entrypoint (Wikipedia fetcher)
│   │   ├── ingest.ts       # Pipeline: chunk → batch-embed → upsert
│   │   ├── chunker.ts      # Paragraph-aware chunking with overlap
│   │   ├── embedder.ts     # AI SDK embed/embedMany
│   │   └── vector-store.ts # Qdrant client (ensure collection, upsert, search)
│   ├── rag/
│   │   ├── retriever.ts    # Vector search (topK × 2 for re-ranking)
│   │   ├── reranker.ts     # LLM re-ranks candidates to top-K
│   │   ├── query-rewriter.ts  # Resolves follow-up questions
│   │   ├── context-builder.ts # Formats chunks with [N] citation IDs
│   │   └── generator.ts    # streamText + generateObject (citations)
│   ├── memory/
│   │   └── memory.service.ts  # Per-session sliding window (10 messages)
│   ├── schemas/
│   │   └── citation.schema.ts # Zod CitationSchema for generateObject
│   ├── evaluation/
│   │   ├── run-evaluate.ts    # pnpm evaluate entrypoint + results table
│   │   ├── evaluate.ts        # Evaluation orchestrator
│   │   ├── judge.ts           # LLM-as-judge (relevance + groundedness)
│   │   ├── metrics.ts         # Programmatic citation accuracy check
│   │   └── test-cases.json    # 12 test cases (factual/multi-doc/follow-up/OOS)
│   └── utils/
│       ├── prompts.ts      # Loads prompts/*.txt with {{variable}} interpolation
│       └── logger.ts       # Structured console logger
├── .env.example
├── package.json
└── tsconfig.json
```

---

## API Reference

### `POST /chat`

Streams an answer with inline citations.

**Request**

```json
{
  "message": "What is the capital of Tunisia?",
  "sessionId": "user-abc-123"
}
```

**Response** — `text/plain` streamed, followed by citation JSON block:

```
The capital of Tunisia is Tunis. [1]

{"__citations":[{"id":1,"sourceTitle":"Tunisia","excerpt":"Tunisia is a country in North Africa. Its capital is Tunis..."}]}
```

### `POST /chat/clear`

Clears conversation history for a session.

**Request**

```json
{ "sessionId": "user-abc-123" }
```

---

## Cost Estimate

| Operation                   | Model                                        | Est. Cost   |
| --------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- | ----------- |
| Ingestion (40 articles)     | text-embedding-3-small                       | ~$0.01      |
| Per chat message            | GPT-4o-mini (rewrite + generate + citations) | ~$0.001     |
| Per evaluation run          | GPT-4o-mini (12 cases × judge + generate)    | ~$0.05      |
| **Total to run everything** |                                              | **< $0.10** |
